## Rows skipped

a10 — Do not restore «courts currently generally impose about 3 / 4 / 6 months». R3 already requires «in some judgments … no typical or guaranteed outcome», and ACCEPTED-ROUND forbids making a result sentence more positive. The 3-month, 4-month, and 6-month figures are already distinguished.
a14 — «بیشترین خسارت» was not restored. R3 replaces “the maximum / highest possible compensation” with the compensation the facts support. Only the broken را was repaired: «خسارتی را که وقایع و ادله پشتیبانی می‌کند».
a21 — Do not restore «B غرامت اخراج قابل توجهی گرفت». R3 requires the anecdote to stop at establishing the statutory entitlement. The current sentence already does that.
a24 — U+200B not deleted, Q16–Q20 not turned into headings, and the empty `**​**` lines in 005 not removed. 003, 005, 006, 008, and 009 match the Korean source, including lines whose only character is U+200B. checkBlocks fails when the ZWSP count or the heading levels diverge.
a35 — «TWD 1.57M» left byte-identical. ACCEPTED-ROUND: a test pins it.
b18 — U+200B not deleted in 013 and 015. Same checker reason as a24.
b23 — Headings were not renumbered from 7 to 6 and 8 to 7. The English source has the same gap, and ACCEPTED-ROUND says not to change numbers. Wording inside those headings was left.

